Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:54.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:57.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.66,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:00.58,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:04.41,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:08.84,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:11.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:13.88,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:21.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.31,0:01:25.31,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:30.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:30.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:34.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:33.94,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:34.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:35.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:40.08,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:39.41,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:40.07,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:41.28,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:45.83,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:49.21,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:51.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.05,0:01:52.50,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:55.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:54.01,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:01:58.01,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:57.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:00.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:00.26,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:03.01,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.64,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:06.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:07.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
